      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reinterpret cast isn\u0027t allowed.\n```\nframeworks/native/libs/binder/ndk/binder_rpc.cpp:280:36: error: reinterpret_cast from \u0027socklen_t\u0027 (aka \u0027unsigned int\u0027) to \u0027size_t\u0027 (aka \u0027unsigned long\u0027) is not allowed\n  280 |     size_t socklen \u003d len \u003c 0 ? 0 : reinterpret_cast\u003csize_t\u003e(len);\n```\n\nstatic cast works, but I\u0027m doing it here to check the size against SIZE_MAX(unsigned long) (which can\u0027t compare with intmax_t) in case size_t is smaller than socklen_t. I don\u0027t think it ever would, but I don\u0027t think there are any guarantees that it won\u0027t.",
